<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals committee sets monthly export refund.</title>
<headline>EU cereals committee sets monthly export refund.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals managment committee has agreed monthly export refunds for processed foods, rice and compound feed, an EU official said on Friday.</p>
<p>According to the officials, the refunds were fixed at -</p>
<p> Wheat		 6.38</p>
<p> Barley	     29.08</p>
<p> Maize		28.89</p>
<p> Oats		 20.87</p>
<p> Rye		  24.10</p>
<p> Durum wheat	 8.68</p>
<p> Rice</p>
<p>    broken	  14.38</p>
<p> Compound feed</p>
<p>    maize-based   28.89</p>
<p>    others	  17.73</p>
</text>
